Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:06.56,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She’ll get the honors because she earned them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将得到荣誉因为这是她赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.51,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}从首盘失利 到躺在地上庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:12.47,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡把这场决赛翻了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:15.29,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.43,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛女单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.41,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}她与卡塔尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:21.83,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}都在争夺生涯第一座{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:26.62,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第一盘 卡塔尔把比分拉到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:29.04,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她在底线不断把球分向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.34,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}让赫瓦林斯卡追着回击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.28,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}长回合里 两个人反复争夺落点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.95,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}谁都没能轻易把对方打穿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.10,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A three is a lucky number in China.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}3{\fs68}在中国是个幸运数字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.76,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is indeed the third set point{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N确实是在第{\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.34,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that gets it done for Sonay Kartal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But she’s hoping it won’t have to go three,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不过她希望不用打满{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:11.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she finds herself halfway home{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她已经走过半程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.44,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}towards capturing a WTA 1000 crown.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N向{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}冠军迈进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:18.56,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 卡塔尔先下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:22.17,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}第二盘 赫瓦林斯卡又以{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.17,0:01:24.00,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}她争到第五个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:27.17,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}才追回一局 再保发追成二平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.64,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}双方又打到三平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.62,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}比分咬住了 胜负还要继续争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.10,TL,,0,0,200,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Chwalinska finally able{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡终于
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:15.48,TL,,0,0,200,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to exact what she was looking for.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿到了她想要的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.61,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}刚破发到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:20.82,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡就被追回来 比分四平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:22.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}卡塔尔把球打向两侧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.31,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她一次次横向追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.17,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把被拉开的球救回
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:29.52,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}领先被追回 就从下一拍再争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}… seals the deal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N锁定这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.12,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Why not?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N何乐而不为
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.03,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}四平之后连拿两局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:07.20,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡把比赛拉回同一起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:08.80,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}决胜盘又来到二平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:10.56,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}她再次拿到破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.34,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}继续用接发球给对手施压
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.58,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she gets some help.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手送上了帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.01,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:25.59,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡又保发 再破发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.37,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}到了她的发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:29.54,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}卡塔尔接连拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.34,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}第三次机会 赫瓦林斯卡仍要顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:10.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She’ll get the honors because she earned them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将得到荣誉因为这是她赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She’ll receive praise of which she is most deserving.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将收获当之无愧的赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.58,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maja Chwalinska’s first WTA title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡的首个巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.88,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}is a big one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就是一座大赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:22.06,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She’s a WTA 1000 champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她成为了{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But what a tug of war it turned out to be{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是一场多么激烈的拉锯战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.16,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in two hours and 43 minutes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打了{\fs78}2{\fs68}小时{\fs78}43{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:32.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Poland’s number two player{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N波兰的第{\fs78}2{\fs68}号球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}is now the one in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今成为武汉的第{\fs78}1{\fs68}名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.94,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She ran the gamut.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她经历了种种考验
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.86,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And everything about the celebration{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接下来的这一切庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.36,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that is about to—she is about to enjoy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这些她即将享受的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}was well earned.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N都是她凭实力赢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:47.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An error-prone start comes with{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N失误频出的开局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.74,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a final fantastic finish.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N迎来了精彩收官
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:52.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Maja Chwalinska is champion{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡成为冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.78,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}of the Wuhan Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N武汉赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.36,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}赫瓦林斯卡{\fs78}23{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:58.68,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}27{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.65,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}卡塔尔{\fs78}32{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:02.92,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}36{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.51,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}决胜盘最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:07.13,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}全被赫瓦林斯卡拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.85,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛制引入后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.59,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}首个巡回赛单打冠军
